{"3307610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Golf Battle", "steam_appid": 3307610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.mp4?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Ultimate Golf Battle</strong> — a chaotic multiplayer twist on classic mini golf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What starts as a relaxing round quickly turns into total mayhem as power-ups, physics, and pure skill collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master tricky courses, outsmart your friends, and prove that precision and chaos can coexist on the green.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Calm Before the Swing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover beautifully crafted, physics-driven courses where every curve and obstacle challenges your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout of wild power-ups before each match — from boosts to shields and more — and prepare for the ultimate golf showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c8d5ad3a8f505f907e67a2173246c314.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=1170 height=748 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c8d5ad3a8f505f907e67a2173246c314.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏌️Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Up to <strong>12 players</strong> in chaotic online matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> with real collisions and trick shots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Power-ups and abilities</strong> that completely change how each round plays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Creative, handcrafted courses</strong> filled with ramps, jumps, and obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Fast-paced rounds</strong> — easy to learn, hard to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Customization</strong> for balls, trails, and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Local and online play</strong>, perfect for both friendly duels and ranked chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Regular content updates</strong> with new arenas and challenges</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Tee Off into Chaos?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re competing with friends or mastering every course solo, <strong>Ultimate Golf Battle</strong> delivers nonstop fun, strategy, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your club, charge your power-ups — and let the battle for the green begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/1f9b4d4545a8eab3f394d55116c52b5f.mp4?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Ultimate Golf Battle</strong> — a chaotic multiplayer twist on classic mini golf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What starts as a relaxing round quickly turns into total mayhem as power-ups, physics, and pure skill collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master tricky courses, outsmart your friends, and prove that precision and chaos can coexist on the green.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Calm Before the Swing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover beautifully crafted, physics-driven courses where every curve and obstacle challenges your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout of wild power-